<html>
 <head>
  <title></title>
 </head>
 <body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
              border-collapse:collapse;
              background-color:#ffffff;" width="100%">
   <tbody>
    <tr>
     <td align="center" style="padding:0;">
      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:760px;
                              width:100%;
                              background-color:#ffffff;
                              border:2px solid #c9a75d;
                              border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
       <tbody>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:0;"><img alt="Arelia Email Banner Image" src="{[devName:Arelia_Email_Banner_Image]}" style="display:block;
                                           width:100%;
                                           max-width:100%;
                                           height:auto;
                                           border:0;" title="Arelia Email Banner Image" /></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:30px 34px 32px 34px;"><p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Dear <strong>[CLIENT_NAME]</strong>,</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">We hope you are doing well.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Please find attached the <strong>Proforma Invoice</strong> for your interior project. This document includes the detailed specifications related to the proposed interior works, such as:</p>
          <ul style="margin-top:8px;
                                           margin-bottom:24px;
                                           padding-left:24px;">
           <li style="margin-bottom:8px;
                                               font-size:18px;
                                               line-height:1.5;
                                               font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                               color:#222222;">Selected brands and materials</li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:8px;
                                               font-size:18px;
                                               line-height:1.5;
                                               font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                               color:#222222;">Scope of interior work</li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:8px;
                                               font-size:18px;
                                               line-height:1.5;
                                               font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                               color:#222222;">Estimated quantities and pricing</li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:0;
                                               font-size:18px;
                                               line-height:1.5;
                                               font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                               color:#222222;">Other relevant project details</li>
          </ul>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;
                                              margin-bottom:18px;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="border-top:1px solid #e3d2a8;
                                                       padding-top:20px;"><p style="margin:0;
                                                          font-size:20px;
                                                          line-height:1.4;
                                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                          color:#1f1f1f;"><strong>Review &amp; Confirmation</strong></p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">We kindly request you to review the attached proforma invoice and confirm one of the following:</p>
          <ul style="margin-top:8px;
                                           margin-bottom:24px;
                                           padding-left:24px;">
           <li style="margin-bottom:10px;
                                               font-size:18px;
                                               line-height:1.5;
                                               font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                               color:#222222;"><strong style="color:#2e844a;">Approve</strong> the proforma if everything looks good, or</li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:0;
                                               font-size:18px;
                                               line-height:1.5;
                                               font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                               color:#222222;"><strong>Request changes</strong> if any modifications or clarifications are required</li>
          </ul> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Please click the button below to submit your approval or feedback:</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;
                                              margin:22px 0 24px 0;">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="background-color:#1b1b1b;
                                                       border:1px solid #c9a75d;
                                                       padding:12px 24px;
                                                       text-align:center;"><a href="[APPROVAL_LINK]" style="font-size:17px;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          color:#ffffff;
                                                          text-decoration:none;
                                                          font-weight:bold;
                                                          display:inline-block;">Review &amp; Approve Proforma Invoice </a></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;
                                              margin-bottom:24px;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="background-color:#faf8f3;
                                                       border-left:3px solid #c9a75d;
                                                       padding:16px 18px;"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;
                                                          font-size:17px;
                                                          line-height:1.5;
                                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                          color:#222222;"><strong>Note:</strong> If the button above does not work, please copy and paste the following link into your browser:</p> <p style="margin:0;
                                                          font-size:15px;
                                                          line-height:1.5;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          word-break:break-all;"><a href="[APPROVAL_LINK]" style="color:#8a6a2f;
                                                              text-decoration:underline;">[APPROVAL_LINK] </a></p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Your feedback is important for us to proceed with the next steps of your project. Should you have any questions or require further clarification, please feel free to reach out to us.</p> <p style="margin:0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Warm regards,<br /> <strong>Arelia Team.</strong></p></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td align="center" style="background-color:#171717;
                                       border-top:2px solid #C99A3D;
                                       padding:24px 32px 22px 32px;
                                       text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
                                          font-size:24px;
                                          line-height:1.3;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#D6B36A;
                                          font-weight:bold;
                                          text-align:center;">Arelia</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:11px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                          color:#C99A3D;
                                          letter-spacing:2px;
                                          text-align:center;">PREMIUM &amp; LUXURY INTERIOR DESIGNS</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td align="center" style="border-top:1px solid #6E5427;
                                                       padding-top:16px;
                                                       text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
                                                          font-size:11px;
                                                          line-height:1.6;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          color:#8F887F;
                                                          text-align:center;">This email was sent because a Proforma Invoice was submitted for your Arelia project.</p> <p style="margin:0;
                                                          font-size:11px;
                                                          line-height:1.6;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          color:#8F887F;
                                                          text-align:center;">© 2026 Arelia. All rights reserved.</p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table></td>
        </tr>
       </tbody>
      </table></td>
    </tr>
   </tbody>
  </table>
 </body>
